  "steps": [
    "Heat the oil and add the cumin seeds and bay leaf.",
    "Add the onions and green chillies and cook until deep golden, then stir in the ginger garlic paste.",
    "Add the tomatoes with the coriander powder, chilli powder, turmeric and salt and cook to a thick paste.",
    "Add the mince and cook on high heat for 8 to 10 minutes, breaking up lumps, until browned and dry.",
    "Add the water and peas, cover and simmer for 15 minutes until the mince is tender.",
    "Sprinkle the garam masala and coriander leaves and serve hot."
